      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a complicated audio setup and spent a good 30 mins trying to hunt down this echo when I finally narrowed it down to my newly uploaded avatar. Happens any time I'm in that avatar. What a strange bug it was driving me nuts! I can hear myself with a delay, everyone else can hear me normally and do not hear the echo.",
